    "body": "Welcome, sounds like you're familiar with https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features. An initial step here that might be interesting is to experiment with this using custom elements. This is a bit cumbersome today as you'll have to add the attributes directly, but in the future some of it should be exposed on `ElementInternals`, so you can emulate built-in elements in a way. Then if those custom elements see wide adoption, that would be a good sign that perhaps they should be added natively to the web platform.\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/a11y ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
